336	    <!-- Hard rule → real .ds-alert-error (docs convention: hard prohibitions are
337	         .ds-alert-error; quiet .callout is for neutral usage notes only). -->
338	    <div class="ds-alert ds-alert-error note-alert">
339	      <svg class="ds-alert-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m15 9-6 6"/><path d="m9 9 6 6"/></svg>
340	      <div class="ds-alert-content">
341	        <p class="ds-alert-title">Inline body links must be underlined</p>
342	        <p>Color contrast against body text is only 3.0:1 in light mode — too marginal to rely on alone.
343	        Underlines are mandatory for inline links per DESIGN-POLICIES.md and WCAG 1.4.1 (use of color).
344	        Standalone navigation links (header, footer, button-like surfaces) may omit the underline.</p>
345	      </div>
