101	    <h1>Organizing content</h1>
102	    <p>The containers that group arXiv's content: the reading-column + sidebar model, accordions,
103	    cards, and chrome that anchors to content (popovers, element pills). The organizing principle
104	    throughout: whitespace first, boxes second — a box is a cost, paid only when proximity alone
105	    can't express the grouping. Reference in action: <a href="../mockups/merged-abstract-reader.html">the merged abstract/reader mockup</a>.</p>
