109	  <section class="section">
110	    <h2 class="section-title">Main column vs. sidebar — what goes where</h2>
111	    <p class="section-desc">The placement rule decided in the version-display work generalizes:
112	    <strong>the main column is what every reader must meet; the rail is what some readers want to browse.</strong>
113	    Screen-reader flow, mobile stacking, and citation-arrival readers all traverse the main column —
114	    a rail may never be opened.</p>
