121	        <div class="slot">Version date line ("Submitted … · Revised …")</div>
122	        <div class="slot hot">Older-version warning (amber, advisory)</div>
123	        <div class="slot">Abstract · body</div>
124	      </div>
125	      <div class="lane">
126	        <strong>Rail (aside)</strong>
127	        Browsable, opt-in:
128	        <div class="slot">Versions accordion (full history)</div>
129	        <div class="slot">Paper information</div>
130	        <div class="slot">Related / Labs</div>
131	      </div>
132	    </div>
133	
134	    <ul class="notes" style="margin-top: 16px;">
135	      <li>The rail is an <code>&lt;aside&gt;</code> with an <code>aria-label</code> — a complementary landmark, not part of the article.</li>
136	      <li>Prose in the main column respects the measure: ~65 characters (~640–720px). Rails stay narrow; their content goes single-column.</li>
